# Between-scene "By One Candle", ~30 s (docs/design/script-episodes-4-8/e5m3.md, shot list U1-U4; beats from
# docs/design/mission-e5-03.md Cinematic hooks `c_e5_turn` and its bridge lines C1-C2). The episode turns from Vessa's
# childhood to Malrik's: snow over the crypt city; grown Malrik's claw hand stops short of pinching a violet candle, the
# heart-stone pulses amber once; he looks into the flame, then at us ("Let me show you."); match cut to the same flame
# in a thin boy's hands among the Wickmoor graves.
# Text source for i18n / voices: data/voice/lines/c_e5_turn.json (the same text as the lines below).
# e5m3 / e5m4 are not built: not in CampaignState.STORY_FILMS yet (play it with run_cine.ps1 play c_e5_turn). The spec
# calls it a PAUSE bridge; it is built as a stage film like the other between-scenes (its own stage, no mission behind).
# Set: forge_intro_malrik (stand-in for the crypt hall and Wickmoor's graves: its candle table and grave rows; its
# prologue host / fx hidden; snow = a pale full-screen grade, the flashback = a cold blue grade). Props: the heart-stone
# (forge_ep3_memories/props/heart_stone_hand.tscn). Stand-ins: the hounds = Grave Hounds.
# Axis: every camera stays east (+X) of Malrik (his axis, as in the outline).
cine c_e5_turn  title="By One Candle"  letterbox=2.39  seed=502  length=28..33
use set forge_intro_malrik
use music res://assets/audio/forge/music/ep3_opening.wav  vol=-24
cast  narrator  capsule  at=(0, 0, -300)  hidden=1  speaker=narrator
cast  stone     res://art/cinematics/stage_sets/forge_ep3_memories/props/heart_stone_hand.tscn  at=(2.75, 0.95, 2.6)
cast  hound1    res://art/units/shadow/grave_hound.tscn  at=(-13.2, 0, 9.6)  yaw=200  hidden=1
cast  hound2    res://art/units/shadow/grave_hound.tscn  at=(-15.4, 0, 9.9)  yaw=160  hidden=1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the crypt city, snow
# Wide, snow falling, slow push: violet lamps in a few crypt windows
shot U1 8.0  cam=dolly  from=(7.0, 3.2, 18.0)  to=(5.6, 2.8, 14.0)  look=(0, 3.4, -12)>(0, 3.0, -12)  fov=46  in=fade_black:1.0
  at 0.0  fade color=#e8eef8  alpha=0.28  time=0.05
  at 0.0  hide sknight
  at 0.0  hide hexweaver
  at 0.0  hide shade
  at 0.0  hide army_host
  at 0.0  hide army_fallen
  at 0.0  hide fx_vortex
  at 0.0  hide fx_tendrils
  at 0.0  hide fx_master
  at 0.0  hide fx_crown
  at 0.0  hide malrik_young
  at 0.0  teleport malrik  to=(2.2, 0, 1.6)  yaw=60
  at 0.0  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/snow_step.wav  vol=-24
  at 1.5  line narrator "The same winter, far to the east, the other apprentice remembered too."  dur=5.0
# CU, static, low key: the claw hand closes on the wick to pinch it, stops, opens again; the heart-stone pulses once
shot U2 7.0  cam=static  from=(4.0, 1.5, 3.6)  look=(3.0, 0.9, 2.3)  fov=30  in=blend:0.4
  at 0.0  fade color=#0b0c26  alpha=0.3  time=0.4
  at 1.0  anim malrik play_cast
  at 3.6  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/stone_thump.wav  vol=-12
  at 3.6  vfx pulse  scene=res://art/cinematics/stage_sets/forge_ep3_memories/props/heart_pulse.tscn  at=(2.75, 0.95, 2.6)  life=2.0  scale=0.5
# Static CU: Malrik looks into the flame, then at the camera
shot U3 9.0  cam=static  from=(4.4, 2.0, 3.4)  look=malrik  fov=28
  at 0.0  anim malrik set_expression  arg=neutral
  at 1.0  line malrik "Everyone thinks the dark found me. I found it. By one candle. Let me show you."  dur=5.6
  at 4.6  anim malrik set_expression  arg=smile
# ECU on the flame, match cut: the same flame in a thin boy's hands among the Wickmoor graves at night
shot U4 3.0  cam=static  from=(3.95, 1.2, 2.9)  look=(3.4, 1.05, 2.2)  fov=24
  at 0.0  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/candle_pinch.wav  vol=-20
  at 0.0  vfx flame  scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/ember.tscn  at=(3.4, 1.1, 2.2)  life=3  scale=0.2
shot U4B 3.0  cam=static  from=(-10.2, 1.9, 15.2)  look=(-14.4, 1.3, 8.9)  fov=38  faces=malrik_young
  at 0.0  fade color=#1a2a4a  alpha=0.3  time=0.05
  at 0.0  show malrik_young
  at 0.0  show hound1
  at 0.0  show hound2
  at 0.0  vfx candle  scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/ember.tscn  at=(-14.2, 0.8, 9.6)  life=3  scale=0.2
  at 2.0  fade color=#000000  alpha=1  time=1.0
